# Act I: the regulars' wager
# Stamping the betting slate (rooms.ts, tavern) opens here.
dialogue regulars
  node slate narrator "I bring the harbour stamp down on the betting slate, under SHE COMES BACK. Three years' wages, officially witnessed by me."
    -> book
  node book regular "A clerk betting on pirates! Put it in the book, Marta, before he sobers up."
    > "I am entirely sober. It's the pirates you should worry about." -> sober
      set wager
    > "And put me down for the first round when she docks." -> round
      set wager
  node sober regular "Sober and stamped. Gods help us, lads, it's binding."
  node round regular "He's buying a round on a ghost ship! Marta, chalk it up. If she comes back we'll drink it, and if she doesn't we'll drink it anyway, sadly."
